---
---

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal"><span class="dot"></span> Live portfolio bots</p>

    <h1 id="hero-title" class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:80ms">
      The future of <span class="text-accent">high-velocity</span> trading is here.
    </h1>

    <p class="lede reveal" style="--reveal-delay:160ms">
      Leverage quantum-inspired neural networks for ultra-low latency execution
      and adaptive risk management — built for institutional liquidity and
      unyielding performance.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-cta reveal" style="--reveal-delay:240ms">
      <a href="/packages" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">View packages <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a href="/support" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">Get a call from our team</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 8.5rem);
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
  }
  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 880px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 16ch;
  }
  .lede {
    color: var(--c-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
  }
</style>
